================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

Open365 integrates or bundles the following third-party open-source components.
Each retains its own copyright and license. Only permissive-licensed components
(MIT / Apache-2.0 / BSD / MPL / ISC) are integrated as code or bundled binaries.
GPL/AGPL projects are referenced for ideas only and NOT linked or copied.

(Components are added here as they are actually integrated. The list below is
the planned integration set — entries become binding once the corresponding
code or binary actually ships.)

